+ *   - drive procedural locomotion (stride-synced hips/knees/arms) — the rig
+ *     is rigid, so there are no baked leg clips, exactly as Document A
+ *     resolved for the arms;
+ *   - apply the Aim Offset (§4): normalized pitch/yaw distributed across the
+ *     spine chain so the external silhouette matches where the 1PS camera
+ *     is looking, in absolute real time;
+ *   - expose Socket_Eyes / Socket_CameraPivot for PerspectiveController, and
+ *     the arm chains for weapon-grip IK;
